            "notes": "### Round 1 Start\n\nIn Round 1, you'll want to start with **Weapon Power** and **Lifesteal** as your two core items.  \nSince you won't be spamming **Take Aim** as much early on, your playstyle should focus on weaving in basic shots between bolts.\n\nThe goal is to **poke enemies down** with your primary fire so that your Sticky Bolts can finish them \u2014 or to soften them up just enough that **a single bolt becomes lethal**.\n\nYou also have some strong flex options depending on the enemy comp and item picks:\n\n- If the enemy has **weapon power-based heroes** like another Freja, Soldier, Cassidy, or Genji, consider taking the **plain 25 Armor** item for early survivability.\n- If you want to boost your early **Take Aim** damage, you can opt for an **ability power item** instead.\n- Alternatively, taking **Charged Plating** early can be a high-value move: when you **ult**, you effectively get the value of **two items in one** \u2014 great for swinging early fights.",
