            "notes": "### Round 2 \u2013 Core Utility Kicks In\n\nRound 2 is when things really start to make sense.\n\nWe\u2019ll pick up the **Tourniquet** item, which gives us a **free charge of Quick Dash** and **50 Overhealth** every time we use **Updraft**.  \nThis is where you can start **annoying the enemy team with frequent Take Aims**, thanks to better mobility and sustain.\n\nThe added survivability from Tourniquet allows you to play more aggressively, weaving in and out of fights while constantly poking and disrupting.  \nAt this point, your **pressure starts to ramp up hard**, especially against teams lacking mobility or burst.\n\nAlong with weapon power!",
