            "notes": "### Round 4 \u2013 Counter the Counters\n\nAt this point, some enemies may be building **armor** to mitigate your damage.  \nIt\u2019s smart to **sell your early green items** and pick up **armor penetration** so you can cut through them \u2014 especially against heroes like **Reinhardt** or **Orisa**, who naturally have high shield or armor values.\n\nYou have a few key choices this round:\n\n- **Ignore Armor Item** \u2013 Helps you burst tanks and armored enemies.\n- **Hardlight Accelerator** \u2013 Optional for extra **weapon power**, especially effective when you\u2019re spamming abilities.\n- **Aerial Distresser** \u2013 Great if the enemy has **flying characters** (Mercy, flying Orisa, aerial Rein, etc). It adds **DoT (damage over time)** from your **primary weapon** when hitting airborne targets \u2014 giving you **free chip damage** while they\u2019re in the air.",
